      "id": "2081188967576195298",
      "text": "RT @ArthurMacwaters: It’s counter intuitive, but birth rate falls when a civilization grows wealthy\n\nThis is disastrous and has ended great…",
      "created_at": "Sun Jul 26 01:24:51 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
